@Teledesk.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Login (Admin padrão criado pelo Seed)
POST {{Teledesk.API_HostAddress}}/api/atendentes/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@teledesk.com",
  "senha": "admin123"
}

### Simular Webhook Oficial do WAHA (https://waha.devlike.pro/swagger/)
POST {{Teledesk.API_HostAddress}}/api/webhook/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "message",
  "session": "default",
  "payload": {
    "id": "true_5511999998888@c.us_3EB0DEMO01",
    "from": "5511999998888@c.us",
    "body": "Olá",
    "fromMe": false,
    "notifyName": "Maria Souza"
  }
}

### Simular Mensagem via Simulador Desktop
POST {{Teledesk.API_HostAddress}}/api/webhook/whatsapp/simular
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumberId": "default",
  "waId": "5511999998888",
  "nomeCliente": "Maria Souza",
  "texto": "1"
}
